{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35457","headline":"病马五首呈郑校书章三吴十五先辈 四 · 曹唐","name":"病马五首呈郑校书章三吴十五先辈 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"空被秋风吹病毛，无因濯浪刷洪涛。\n卧来总怪龙蹄跙，瘦尽谁惊虎口高。\n追电有心犹欵段，逢人相骨强嘶号。\n欲将鬐鬣重裁剪，乞借新成利铰刀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹唐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35457.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35457","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}